('learn-sql-dbms-transactions-check',1,'learn-sql-dbms-transactions-core',1,'scenario','Lost updates and isolation · Check your understanding','A and B both read 100. A writes 80. B writes 70 from its stale value. Which anomaly is illustrated?','["Dirty read","Lost update","Phantom read"]','medium',120,'published'),
('learn-operating-systems-processes-check',1,'learn-operating-systems-processes-core',1,'multiple_choice','Process address spaces · Check your understanding','Which normally has its own virtual address space?','["Each function call","Each process","Each local variable"]','easy',120,'published'),
